{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 64,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.1129150390625,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "that beta-lactams were more effective than fluoroquinolones in reducing diarrhoea",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.12286376953125,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "among children with proven Shigella dysentery [pivmecillinam and nalidixic acid,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.0428466796875,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "Alam 1994; ciprofloxacin and ampicillin, Bennish 1990; nalidixic acid and ampicillin,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.1028747558594,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "Haltalin 1973; ciprofloxacin and ceftriaxone, Leibovitz 2000; nalidixic acid and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        342.2228698730469,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "ampicillin, Salam 1988; ciprofloxacin and pivmecillinam, Salam 1998].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.0616760253906,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "Drug resistance patterns from several trails show that at various periods of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.74208068847656,
        399.14276123046875,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "time different antibiotics have been effective against Shigella dysentery isolates in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        168.8632049560547,
        150.52207946777344,
        212.35324096679688,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "Table A6.1",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.74208068847656,
        396.8089599609375,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "different parts of the world ( ). The antibiotics used included ampicillin, co-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.7421112060547,
        399.08282470703125,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "trimoxazole, nalidixic acid, and fluoroquinolones like ciprofloxacin, pivmecillinam,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        176.7421112060547,
        399.09271240234375,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "ceftriaxone, and azithromycin. Oral gentamicin was relatively ineffective, due to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        189.7421112060547,
        399.0229187011719,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "poor absorption when given orally, compared to nalidixic acid and therefore is not",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        202.7421112060547,
        399.0327453613281,
        216.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "recommended. However, there is evidence of high rates of resistance of Shigella",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        215.7421112060547,
        399.06298828125,
        229.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "dysentery in some parts of the world to ampicillin, co-trimoxazole, chloramphenicol,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        228.7421112060547,
        131.60292053222656,
        242.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "and nalidixic acid.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        241.7421112060547,
        399.0814514160156,
        255.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "The CHERG systematic review identifies eight studies, with some studies",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        254.7421112060547,
        399.0229187011719,
        268.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "contributing data for multiple antibiotics or more than one outcome measure. Eight",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        267.7420959472656,
        399.1927795410156,
        281.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "studies reported on clinical failure (12 unique data points), most of them 3 days after",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        280.7420959472656,
        399.0628662109375,
        294.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "treatment was initiated (range 3–6 days). Four studies reported on bacteriological",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        293.7420959472656,
        399.1029968261719,
        307.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "failure (6 unique data points) and five reported on bacteriological relapse (seven",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        306.7420959472656,
        137.48289489746094,
        320.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "unique data points).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        319.7420959472656,
        296.94158935546875,
        333.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "Results of the CHERG systematic review were as follows:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        338.411376953125,
        399.09185791015625,
        351.9013977050781
      ],
      "text": "Clinical failure: Antibiotics (ciprofloxacin, pivmecillinam, ceftriaxone, and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        340.6378479003906,
        63.541900634765625,
        349.6378479003906
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        351.411376953125,
        399.0813293457031,
        364.9013977050781
      ],
      "text": "azithromycin) reduce clinical signs of dysentery in 99.9% (95% CI 99.5–100) of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        364.411376953125,
        91.1515121459961,
        377.9013977050781
      ],
      "text": "cases.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        377.411376953125,
        399.101806640625,
        390.9013977050781
      ],
      "text": "Bacteriological failure: Antibiotics successfully clear dysentery pathogens from",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        379.6378479003906,
        63.541900634765625,
        388.6378479003906
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        390.411376953125,
        201.14154052734375,
        403.9013977050781
      ],
      "text": "100% (95% CI 99.9–100) of cases.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        403.411376953125,
        399.1416931152344,
        416.9013977050781
      ],
      "text": "Bacteriological relapse: Antibiotics successfully prevent bacteriological relapse in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        405.6378479003906,
        63.541900634765625,
        414.6378479003906
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        416.411376953125,
        194.5015411376953,
        429.9013977050781
      ],
      "text": "100% (95% CI 99–100) of cases.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        440.9300231933594,
        167.1328582763672,
        452.9200134277344
      ],
      "text": "7.1.2\t Benefits and risks:",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        456.57470703125,
        88.77290344238281,
        468.7146911621094
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        469.5846862792969,
        399.1528015136719,
        483.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "Reductions in clinical and bacteriological failure, likely reduction in time to cessation",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        482.5846862792969,
        177.7929229736328,
        496.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "of diarrhoea or bloody stools.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        504.0786437988281,
        78.65290069580078,
        516.2186279296875
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        517.088623046875,
        399.10296630859375,
        530.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "None of the antibiotics studied in the trials were associated with major adverse events",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        530.088623046875,
        148.07290649414062,
        543.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "that were drug related.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        554.607177734375,
        208.3529815673828,
        566.5972290039062
      ],
      "text": "7.1.3\t Acceptability and feasibility:",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        570.2619018554688,
        399.0828552246094,
        583.7518920898438
      ],
      "text": "Shigellosis can lead to life-threatening complications, including sepsis, intestinal",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        583.2619018554688,
        399.0928649902344,
        596.7518920898438
      ],
      "text": "perforation, toxic megacolon, and, in predisposed individuals, haemolytic uraemic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        596.2619018554688,
        399.06304931640625,
        609.7518920898438
      ],
      "text": "syndrome and Reiter’s syndrome. As a result, value was placed on recommending an",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        609.2619018554688,
        399.1328125,
        622.7518920898438
      ],
      "text": "effective antibiotic treatment. The benefits of effective antibiotic therapy outweigh",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.3970947265625,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.6501007080078,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "50",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}